  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行行长：支持中央汇金发挥类“平准基金”作用",
  "title_en": "PBOC Governor: Central Bank Will Support Central Huijin in Playing a Quasi-\"Stabilization Fund\" Role",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "近日，中国人民银行行长潘功胜在全国人大常委会上作了关于金融工作的报告。他表示，央行会支持中央汇金公司，让它发挥类似“平准基金”的作用。",
      "en": "Recently, People's Bank of China Governor Pan Gongsheng delivered a report on financial work to the NPC Standing Committee. He said the central bank will support Central Huijin in playing a role similar to a \"market stabilization fund\"."
    },
    {
      "zh": "平准基金是一种资金，政府在市场大跌时用它买入资产，让价格稳定下来。中央汇金是一家国家投资公司。报告说，这样做是为了让股票、债券和外汇市场都平稳运行。",
      "en": "A stabilization fund is a pool of money that a government uses to buy assets when the market falls sharply, so that prices calm down. Central Huijin is a state investment company. The report said the aim is to keep the stock, bond and foreign exchange markets all running steadily."
    },
    {
      "zh": "2025年4月，市场大幅下跌，中央汇金曾买入交易所交易基金来支持市场。后来，监管部门多次重复了这个说法。",
      "en": "In April 2025, the market fell sharply, and Central Huijin bought exchange-traded funds to support it. Since then, regulators have repeated this position many times."
    },
    {
      "zh": "另外，11月2日，央行宣布把股票回购增持再贷款的利率降到1%，并改为长期安排。",
      "en": "In addition, on November 2, the central bank announced it was lowering the rate on the stock buyback and shareholding-increase re-lending facility to 1% and making it a long-term arrangement."
    }
  ],
